 also maybe change a light in front of  your house to purple to get the  conversation going about this now there  are some resources out there for people  who are facing problems  we do have a link and a hotline number  up on our website just click on this  story  just head to eightnessnow.com reporting  live here on the las vegas stream joe  mullen 8 news now
 

